---
// Trust & Operational Metrics for Shree Chowdeshwari Tours & Travels
---

<section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-[#FAF8F5] border-b border-[#E8E2D6] relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-10">
      <!-- Metric 1 -->
      <div class="space-y-1.5 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#E8E2D6] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#171717] tracking-tight">15</span>
          <span class="text-[#B89B5E] text-2xl font-bold">+</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-[#171717] block">
          Years of Trust
        </span>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed">
          Bangalore's trusted Tours &amp; Travel operator with thousands of completed holiday trips.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 2 -->
      <div class="space-y-1.5 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#E8E2D6] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#171717] tracking-tight">50,000</span>
          <span class="text-[#B89B5E] text-2xl font-bold">+</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-[#171717] block">
          Happy Travelers
        </span>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed">
          Family vacations, pilgrimage groups, honeymoon escapes &amp; corporate outstation trips.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 3 -->
      <div class="space-y-1.5 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#E8E2D6] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#171717] tracking-tight">100</span>
          <span class="text-[#B89B5E] text-2xl font-bold">%</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-[#171717] block">
          Company-Owned Fleet
        </span>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed">
          Verified Innova Crysta, Fortuner, Force Urbania &amp; Tempo Travellers. Zero third-party risk.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Metric 4 -->
      <div class="space-y-1.5 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#E8E2D6] shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#171717] tracking-tight">4.95</span>
          <span class="text-[#B89B5E] text-xl">★</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-[#171717] block">
          Google Rated
        </span>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#6B7280] leading-relaxed">
          Top-rated for punctuality, verified driver etiquette, and transparent all-inclusive billing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
